OL,3,A'Complete system reset' needed to get
OL,4,A440,000 young people into work, says
OL,5,Amajor review
OL,6,
OL,7,FSweeping reforms are needed to help
OL,8,F440,000 more young people into work,
OL,9,Faccording to former minister Alan
OL,10,FMilburn.
OL,12,FAlmost one million young people aged 16
OL,13,Fto 24 in the UK are not in education,
OL,14,Femployment or training - or "Neet" - a
OL,15,Fcurrent rate of 13%, which Milburn
OL,16,Fwants to fall to around 5% within a
OL,17,Fdecade.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1794871120
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Complete system reset' needed to get
OL,4,A440,000 young people into work, says
OL,5,Amajor review
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis government-commissioned review, due
OL,8,Fto be published in full on Tuesday,
OL,9,Fcalls for ministers to intervene from
OL,10,Fearly childhood through to adulthood,
OL,11,Ffunded in part by radical changes to
OL,12,Fbenefits for young adults.
OL,14,FBut Helen Whately, Conservative shadow
OL,15,Fwork and pensions secretary, said
OL,16,FMilburn's proposals were in parts "too
OL,17,Fcautious" and too reliant on the
OL,18,F"expensive hand of the state".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
