SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1794871120
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABarristers must stop using rape myths
OL,4,Ain trials, justice secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn his closing speech, Brand's defence
OL,7,Fbarrister, Ian Winter KC, questioned
OL,8,Fwhy his client's accusers had not
OL,9,Ffought back.
OL,11,FThe BSB said it had set up an expert
OL,12,Fgroup this year to advise on
OL,13,F"strengthening standards for
OL,14,Fbarristers", while the Bar Council said
OL,15,Fdefendants had a "right to have
OL,16,Fevidence tested in court".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
