OL,3,ANvidia dismisses 'Bring Jensen Back'
OL,4,Acampaign as Trump backs effort to
OL,5,Areinstate ex CEO
OL,6,
OL,7,FNvidia has dismissed a campaign calling
OL,8,Ffor Jensen Huang to be handed back his
OL,9,Fjob as allies, including US President
OL,10,FDonald Trump, backed the effort.
OL,12,FTrump said on Monday that he "would
OL,13,Fcertainly not mind" if Huang was
OL,14,Freinstated, adding to a list of
OL,15,Fsupporters who are backing a "Bring
OL,16,FJensen Back" campaign.
OL,18,FFellow tech bosses, including SpaceX's
OL,19,FElon Musk and Tim Sweeney, chief
OL,20,Fexecutive of Fortnite-maker Epic Games,
OL,21,Fhave also supported Huang's return.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
