OL,3,ANvidia dismisses 'Bring Jensen Back'
OL,4,Acampaign as Trump backs effort to
OL,5,Areinstate ex CEO
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the BBC has been told the board of
OL,8,Fthe AI chip giant is not interested in
OL,9,Fbringing him back after he resigned
OL,10,Flast week following revelations he had
OL,11,Ftwo affairs, including one that
OL,12,Finvolved a suspected Chinese spy.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
