OL,3,ALandmark Crimea bridge hit as Russia
OL,4,Areports biggest Ukrainian drone attack
OL,5,Aof war
OL,6,
OL,7,FKyiv, meanwhile, came under a record 17
OL,8,Fair raid alerts in a single day. At
OL,9,Fleast seven people were killed by
OL,10,FRussian strikes and attacks on energy
OL,11,Finfrastructure caused blackouts for
OL,12,F50,000 people.
OL,14,FThe intense strikes come days after US,
OL,15,FUkrainian and Russian envoys held talks
OL,16,Faimed at ending the war.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
